    "features": "<p><strong>AKA:</strong> Fido, K-9</p><p>Guard dogs are the bane of any unwelcome visitor, from door-to-door vendors to burglars. Though some dogs have a worse bark than bite, many guard dogs come from large breeds, traditionally selected for the task. Skilled individuals can placate a guard dog, no matter how vicious it was trained to act, but feral dogs are often more difficult to deal with.</p><p><strong>Favored Stunts:</strong> Knock Prone, Latch On (3 SP)</p><p><strong>Stunt - Latch On:</strong> The dog sinks its teeth into the target and won’t let go. The target can’t move without suffering bite damage (1d6+2) unless they choose to drop prone. This lasts until the dog’s next major action.</p><p><strong>Talents:</strong> Observation (Novice), Scouting (Novice)</p>",
